<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= botName %> — ระบบจัดการ Discord อัตโนมัติระดับโปร</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/modern-pro.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    /* ==========================================================================
       Devplus Bot — Crafted Anti-Slop Cyberpunk UI
       Engineered for substance, precision typography, and zero-gimmick layout
       ========================================================================== */

    /* Preloader */
    #loader {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 99999;
      background: #060709;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      transition: opacity .35s ease, visibility .35s;
    }
    #loader.done { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; }
    .loader-brand {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: 52px; letter-spacing: 6px; color: #FFF;
      position: relative;
    }
    .loader-brand::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute;
      left: 50%; bottom: -12px; transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 0; height: 2px;
      background: var(--neon-cyan);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--neon-cyan);
      animation: loaderProgress 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes loaderProgress {
      0% { width: 0; } 50% { width: 90px; } 100% { width: 0; }
    }
    .loader-sub {
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 4px;
      color: var(--text-faint); margin-top: 24px;
      text-transform: uppercase; font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif;
    }

    /* Ambient Blueprint Grid (Crafted, No Fuzzy AI Orbs) */
    .blueprint-bg {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
      background-image: 
        linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 40px 40px;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 20%, #000 40%, transparent 90%);
      -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 20%, #000 40%, transparent 90%);
    }
    .top-glow-beam {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 1000px; height: 320px;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.12), transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
    }

    /* Nav Bar */
    .ceo-nav {
      position: fixed; top: 18px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      z-index: 1000; width: calc(100% - 40px); max-width: 1180px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background: rgba(10, 11, 16, 0.82);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    .ceo-nav-brand {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      text-decoration: none; color: #FFF;
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.35rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    }
    .ceo-nav-brand img {
      width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid var(--neon-cyan);
    }
    .nav-badge {
      font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--neon-cyan); background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
      padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .ceo-nav-links {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px;
    }
    .ceo-nav-links a {
      color: var(--text-dim); text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .ceo-nav-links a:hover { color: #FFF; }
    .ceo-nav-links a.active { color: var(--neon-cyan); }

    /* Hero Layout */
    .hero-container {
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
      max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 130px 24px 60px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero-pill-badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      padding: 6px 16px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-dim);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .pulse-dot {
      width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: #10B981; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #10B981;
    }

    .hero-headline {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', 'Kanit', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(48px, 8.5vw, 105px);
      line-height: 0.95; font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #FFF;
    }
    .hero-headline .text-accent {
      color: var(--neon-cyan);
      text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35);
    }
    .hero-subhead {
      font-size: clamp(14px, 1.8vw, 17px);
      color: var(--text-dim); max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 32px;
      line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 400;
    }

    .hero-cta-group {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .btn-discord-primary {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      background: #5865F2; color: #FFF;
      font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem;
      padding: 13px 28px; border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.3);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn-discord-primary:hover {
      background: #4752C4; transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.45);
    }
    .btn-cyan-outline {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05); color: var(--neon-cyan);
      font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem;
      padding: 13px 28px; border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn-cyan-outline:hover {
      background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15); transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: var(--neon-cyan);
    }

    /* Live Telemetry Bar */
    .telemetry-bar {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px;
      background: rgba(16, 18, 26, 0.75);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      padding: 10px 28px; margin: 0 auto 50px;
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim);
    }
    .telemetry-item strong {
      color: #FFF; font-weight: 700; margin-right: 4px;
    }
    .telemetry-sep {
      width: 1px; height: 16px; background: var(--border);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       Interactive Discord OS Showcase (Authentic Product Substance)
       ========================================================================== */
    .discord-showcase {
      max-width: 1050px; margin: 0 auto;
      background: #0B0D14;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
      border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08);
      text-align: left;
    }
    .showcase-header {
      background: #0E101A;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .window-controls {
      display: flex; gap: 7px;
    }
    .wc-dot { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; }
    .wc-red { background: #FF5F56; }
    .wc-yellow { background: #FFBD2E; }
    .wc-green { background: #27C93F; }

    .showcase-tab-pills {
      display: flex; gap: 8px;
    }
    .showcase-tab-btn {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;
      padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .showcase-tab-btn:hover { color: #FFF; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
    .showcase-tab-btn.active {
      background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.12);
      border-color: var(--neon-cyan);
      color: var(--neon-cyan); font-weight: 600;
    }

    .showcase-body {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
      min-height: 420px;
    }
    @media(max-width: 820px) {
      .showcase-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .discord-channels-col { display: none; }
    }

    /* Left Sidebar: Discord Channel Hierarchy */
    .discord-channels-col {
      background: #090B10;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 16px 12px;
      font-size: 13px; font-family: 'Inter', 'Kanit', sans-serif;
    }
    .dc-server-title {
      font-weight: 700; color: #FFF; font-size: 14px;
      padding: 0 8px 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .dc-category {
      font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-faint);
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      margin: 14px 8px 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
    }
    .dc-channel {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      color: var(--text-dim); padding: 5px 8px; border-radius: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 2px; transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
      cursor: default;
    }
    .dc-channel.active, .dc-channel:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); color: #FFF;
    }
    .dc-channel i { font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.6; }
    .dc-badge-lock {
      margin-left: auto; font-size: 10px; color: #F59E0B;
    }

    /* Right Main Panel: Command Console & Embed Output */
    .discord-chat-col {
      padding: 20px 24px;
      background: #0D0F18;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .chat-message-row {
      display: flex; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .chat-avatar {
      width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--neon-cyan); flex-shrink: 0;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .chat-content { flex: 1; }
    .chat-author {
      font-weight: 600; color: #FFF; font-size: 14px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .bot-tag {
      background: #5865F2; color: #FFF; font-size: 9px;
      padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: 700;
    }
    .chat-time {
      font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-faint); font-weight: 400;
    }

    /* Discord High-Fidelity Embed */
    .discord-embed-card {
      border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-cyan);
      background: rgba(20, 24, 36, 0.9);
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
      padding: 14px 18px; max-width: 620px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    .embed-title {
      font-weight: 700; color: #FFF; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    }
    .embed-desc {
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .embed-field-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .embed-field {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .ef-name { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-faint); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; }
    .ef-val { font-size: 12px; color: #FFF; font-weight: 500; margin-top: 2px; }

    .embed-buttons {
      display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .btn-discord-action {
      background: #5865F2; color: #FFF;
      border: none; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    }
    .btn-discord-action.green { background: #23A55A; }
    .btn-discord-action.grey { background: #4E5058; }

    /* Interactive Terminal Input */
    .chat-input-bar {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 13px;
    }
    .input-slash-cmd {
      color: var(--neon-cyan); font-weight: 600;
    }
    .btn-copy-cmd {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 11px; padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-copy-cmd:hover { color: #FFF; border-color: var(--neon-cyan); }

    /* ==========================================================================
       Asymmetric Bento Grid (Architectural & Substance Driven)
       ========================================================================== */
    .bento-section {
      max-width: 1200px; margin: 90px auto 0;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }
    .bento-header {
      text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px;
    }
    .section-tag {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 3px; color: var(--neon-cyan);
      text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .bento-title {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', 'Kanit', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 56px);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: #FFF;
    }

    .asymmetric-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .bento-box {
      background: var(--surface-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
      transition: border-color 0.25s, transform 0.25s;
    }
    .bento-box:hover {
      border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }
    .col-span-8 { grid-column: span 8; }
    .col-span-4 { grid-column: span 4; }
    .col-span-6 { grid-column: span 6; }
    .col-span-12 { grid-column: span 12; }

    @media(max-width: 900px) {
      .col-span-8, .col-span-4, .col-span-6 { grid-column: span 12; }
    }

    .box-icon-pill {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25);
      color: var(--neon-cyan); font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .box-heading {
      font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #FFF; margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .box-desc {
      font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Role Security Pills */
    .role-pyramid {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .role-pill {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }
    .role-founder { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); color: #EF4444; border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3); }
    .role-admin { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color: #F59E0B; border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3); }
    .role-mod { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); color: #3B82F6; border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3); }
    .role-vip { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15); color: #A855F7; border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3); }
    .role-bot { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: #10B981; border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); }
    .role-verified { background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15); color: #00F0FF; border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3); }

    /* Switch Component Preview */
    .feature-toggle-row {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 10px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--text);
    }
    .toggle-active-status {
      color: #10B981; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
    }

    /* Reviews Section */
    .reviews-section {
      max-width: 1200px; margin: 90px auto 40px;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }
    .reviews-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px; margin-top: 32px;
    }
    .review-item {
      background: var(--surface-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px;
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }
    .review-item:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .review-stars { color: #F59E0B; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 10px; }

    /* Footer */
    .master-footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 36px 24px; text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-dim);
      margin-top: 80px; position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }
    .master-footer a { color: var(--neon-cyan); text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Preloader -->
  <div id="loader">
    <div class="loader-brand">DEVPLUS BOT</div>
    <div class="loader-sub">INITIALIZING DISCORD OS...</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Background Architecture (Clean, Anti-Slop Blueprint) -->
  <div class="blueprint-bg"></div>
  <div class="top-glow-beam"></div>

  <!-- Floating Nav Header -->
  <nav class="ceo-nav">
    <a href="/" class="ceo-nav-brand">
      <% if (botAvatar) { %>
        <img src="<%= botAvatar %>" alt="Devplus Bot">
      <% } else { %>
        <img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/0.png" alt="Devplus Bot">
      <% } %>
      DEVPLUS
      <span class="nav-badge">V2.4</span>
    </a>

    <div class="ceo-nav-links">
      <a href="#showcase" class="active">โครงสร้างระบบ</a>
      <a href="#features">ความปลอดภัย 7 ระดับ</a>
      <a href="#reviews">รีวิวผู้ใช้</a>
      <a href="<%= inviteURL %>" target="_blank">เชิญบอท</a>
    </div>

    <div>
      <% if (user) { %>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
          <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-cyan-outline" style="padding: 7px 18px; font-size: 13px;">
            <i class="fas fa-th-large"></i> Dashboard
          </a>
          <a href="/auth/logout" style="color: var(--text-dim); padding: 8px;" title="ออกจากระบบ">
            <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      <% } else { %>
        <a href="/auth/login" class="btn-discord-primary" style="padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 13px;">
          <i class="fab fa-discord"></i> เข้าสู่ระบบ
        </a>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <main class="hero-container">
    <div class="hero-pill-badge">
      <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
      <span>Discord API v10 Verified</span>
      <span style="opacity: 0.4;">|</span>
      <span style="color: var(--neon-cyan);">Zero-Trust Auto Setup</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero-headline">
      ยกระดับเซิร์ฟเวอร์ DISCORD<br>
      <span class="text-accent">ด้วยสถาปัตยกรรมระดับโปร</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-subhead">
      สร้างโครงสร้างช่อง, แบ่งยศ 7 ระดับ, ระบบป้องกันการบุกรุก (Anti-Nuke), 
      และเกทเวย์ยืนยันตัวตนอัตโนมัติครบวงจร พร้อมแดชบอร์ดควบคุมสดผ่านเว็บ
    </p>

    <div class="hero-cta-group">
      <% if (user) { %>
        <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-cyan-outline">
          <i class="fas fa-columns"></i> เข้าสู่หน้าจัดการเซิร์ฟเวอร์
        </a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a href="/auth/login" class="btn-discord-primary">
          <i class="fab fa-discord"></i> เข้าสู่ระบบด้วย Discord
        </a>
      <% } %>
      <a href="<%= inviteURL %>" target="_blank" class="btn-cyan-outline">
        <i class="fas fa-plus"></i> เชิญบอทสู่เซิร์ฟเวอร์
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Live Telemetry -->
    <div class="telemetry-bar">
      <div class="telemetry-item">
        <strong><%= serverCount || 0 %></strong> เซิร์ฟเวอร์
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-sep"></div>
      <div class="telemetry-item">
        <strong><%= userCount || 0 %></strong> สมาชิกในการดูแล
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-sep"></div>
      <div class="telemetry-item">
        <strong style="color: #10B981;">99.98%</strong> Uptime 24/7
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-sep"></div>
      <div class="telemetry-item">
        <strong style="color: var(--neon-cyan);">~18ms</strong> API Latency
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Discord OS Showcase -->
    <div class="discord-showcase" id="showcase">
